      "date": "2023-08-29T14:54:20Z",
      "title": "Add neo4j vector support (#9770)",
      "text": "Add neo4j vector support (#9770)\n\nNeo4j has added vector index integration just recently. To allow both\r\ningestion and integrating it as vector RAG applications, I wrapped it as\r\na vector store as the implementation is completely different from\r\n`GraphCypherQAChain`. Here, we are not generating any Cypher statements\r\nat query time, we are simply doing the vector similarity search using\r\nthe new vector index as if we were dealing with a vector database.\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Bagatur <baskaryan@gmail.com>",
      "url": "https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchain/commit/db13fba7ea28131a296d3f898b92cf9d1d27ba79",
      "expected": true,
      "annotation": "Neo4j vector store for RAG applications",
      "changed_files": [
        "docs/extras/integrations/vectorstores/neo4jvector.ipynb",
        "libs/langchain/langchain/vectorstores/__init__.py",
        "libs/langchain/langchain/vectorstores/neo4j_vector.py",
        "libs/langchain/tests/integration_tests/vectorstores/docker-compose/neo4j.yml",
        "libs/langchain/tests/integration_tests/vectorstores/test_neo4jvector.py"
      ]
    },
